  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Nookat Water Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Action will facilitate access to higher quality water, improve public health and increase system resilience to provide more continuous water services in Nookat City and Frunze, Chapaev, Noygut and Aral villages.</narrative>
